gin tickets branch, but no retirement/cleanup path is stated for it — unlike the feature branch, the ticket appears to accumulate in the live tickets store across runs.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f91029baeaf727011","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan-review remediation 2026-09-08 — 'create or identify a disposable rebar ticket, publish that ticket-store write to the origin tickets branch'","norm_id":"n733de60acc3e3dd9","priority":1.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Repeated E2E runs accumulate disposable tickets in the live origin tickets branch with no cleanup, growing the store indefinitely."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a cleanup step that retires or marks-resolved the disposable ticket (and its tickets-branch write) on run completion/failure, and fail as HARNESS-FAILURE if ticket cleanup cannot complete — mirroring the feature-branch cleanup contract.","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"uncertifiable_outcome","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"high","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Reconcile with the existing infra/gerrit/feature-branch-e2e.sh (which already targets a replicated feature/* branch, polls both LLM-Review and Verified, threads a rebar-ticket: trailer, and cleans up the branch): either extend/parameterize reviewbot-e2e.sh to reuse that harness's helpers or state an explicit positive rationale for a distinct single-change script.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.1722,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["infra/gerrit/feature-branch-e2e.sh header: 'Sibling to reviewbot-e2e.sh; where that script proves the SINGLE-change happy path, this one proves the FEATURE-BRANCH flow'","feature-branch-e2e.sh defaults: FB=feature/e2e-<date>, REVIEW_BOT_NAME/CI_BOT_NAME, LLM_REVIEW_MAX/VERIFIED_MAX, TICKET/TRAILER (rebar-ticket:), account_vote()/sr_status() poll BOTH labels","docs/88ab-feature-branch-evidence.md: 'a feature/* change earns BOTH gate votes end-to-end' (changes 248/251/252/254) proven live via the same harness","The plan's Final amendment lists 'repository facts' but only searches for reviewbot-e2e ownership; it never mentions the existing sibling feature-branch harness that already implements the target flow"],"finding":"The plan reimplements a two-vote, feature-branch, ticket-trailer E2E in reviewbot-e2e.sh without referencing the already-committed infra/gerrit/feature-branch-e2e.sh, which already targets a replicated feature/* branch, polls BOTH LLM-Review AND Verified, threads a rebar-ticket: trailer, and does feature-branch create/delete/abandon cleanup — the exact mechanism the plan builds.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f9b3a640b9524ac20","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan-review re-dispatch 2026-09-07 + Plan-review remediation 2026-09-08 (feature/e2e-gate-smoke target; two-vote wait; ticket trailer; branch cleanup)","norm_id":"n645fa555523a7ee3","priority":0.4278,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An implementer builds a second full two-vote+feature-branch harness in reviewbot-e2e.sh, duplicating (and likely diverging from) feature-branch-e2e.sh's already-proven conventions, doubling maintenance surface for the same live mechanism"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add a Context/Approach note that feature-branch-e2e.sh already proves the two-vote feature/* flow, and scope reviewbot-e2e.sh's change to REUSE its api_get/account_vote/sr_status/branch-lifecycle conventions (or explicitly justify why reviewbot-e2e.sh remains a separate single-change probe rather than folding into the sibling harness).","tier":"LLM","validity":0.7778,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"incomplete_enumeration","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"moderate","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":null,"blocking_enabled":null,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":null,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["2 criterion line(s) bundle multiple deliverables with 'and' (split so each is independently verifiable)."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc801a522e3","priority":0.4,"