e/e2e-gate-smoke; one run's cleanup deletes the ref the other is mid-verifying, producing a spurious HARNESS-FAILURE or a wrong Verified observation."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Use a run-unique branch name (e.g. feature/e2e-gate-smoke-<run-id>) or document/enforce single-run exclusivity, so create/observe/delete are isolated per run.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"Acknowledge infra/gerrit/feature-branch-e2e.sh (which already implements both-vote polling, the rebar-ticket+DCO trailer, feature-branch replication-wait, and branch cleanup) and justify duplicating this machinery in reviewbot-e2e.sh vs. extracting shared helpers or delegating to the existing sibling.","cohort":["A1"],"criteria":["A1"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["feature-branch-e2e.sh defines poll_both_votes() which polls BOTH 'LLM-Review' (REVIEW_BOT_NAME) and 'Verified' (CI_BOT_NAME) until both are non-NONE — the exact both-vote wait the plan describes adding to reviewbot-e2e.sh.","feature-branch-e2e.sh builds the trailer via TICKET/TRAILER ($'\\n\\nrebar-ticket: '\"${TICKET}\") and installs a prepare-commit-msg DCO Signed-off-by hook — the same 'resolvable rebar-ticket trailer plus DCO sign-off' AC.","feature-branch-e2e.sh ensure_fb() creates the feature branch and WAITS for it to replicate to the GitHub mirror before pushing ('did not replicate to GitHub within 120s (CI dispatch would race)'), and cleanup() deletes the Gerrit + GitHub feature branch — the identical replication-wait + branch-cleanup the 're-dispatch' section specifies.","feature-branch-e2e.sh header: 'Sibling to reviewbot-e2e.sh ... mirrors reviewbot-e2e.sh's conventions (XSSI-stripping api_get, the log/pass/harness/blocked terminal-state helpers, the vote/submit-requirement parsers, and the GitHub-replication poll) but generalizes the vote reader to BOTH labels'.","The plan text (all four amendment sections) never mentions feature-branch-e2e.sh."],"finding":"The plan re-implements both-vote polling, the rebar-ticket trailer + DCO, feature-branch create/replication-wait, and feature-branch cleanup in reviewbot-e2e.sh, but an existing sibling script infra/gerrit/feature-branch-e2e.sh already implements all of these; the plan never acknowledges the sibling or evaluates extracting shared helpers vs. duplicating them.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f1a9b70089c038be1","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach + 'Plan-review re-dispatch 2026-09-07' + 'Plan-review remediation 2026-09-08'","norm_id":"nef0e3453e61a8e1a","priority":0.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Both e2e scripts drift over time because the both-vote/replication/cleanup logic is copy-pasted twice instead of shared, so a future gate/label change must be made in two places.","A reviewer or maintainer cannot tell whether reviewbot-e2e.sh should have been folded into / delegated to the already-generalized feature-branch-e2e.sh flow."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add an App